OL,3,APassenger train derails in France
OL,4,Aleaving at least 44 injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added that 140 firefighters and
OL,7,Fother emergency teams were being
OL,8,Fdeployed to the scene of the crash on
OL,9,FFriday evening near the commune of
OL,10,FCleon, just south of Rouen.
